  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Installation of a double sided internally illuminated digital display on the proposed communications hub",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed communication hub, by reason of its improper siting and design, would result in an unnecessary and harmful addition to street clutter within this section of the public streetscape, where existing street infrastructure and structures already exist in close proximity. The cumulative impact of these features would detract from the established character of this section of the public highway and diminish the quality of the public realm. The proposal is therefore contrary to London Plan Policy D8, T1 and T2, Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2 and CC5, and the aims of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed communication hub, by reason of its excessive scale, siting and design would result in an unacceptable level of obstruction to driver visibility and cyclist and pedestrian movement within a sensitive section of the public highway, and would adversely affect highway and pedestrian safety. The development would therefore be contrary to London Plan Policy D8, T1 and T2, Local Plan Policy EC2 and CC5, and the aims of the National Planning Policy Framework."
  ],
